down/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":828},{"title":"Console - timeEnd\\(String label\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":852},{"title":"Console - Scoped, Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":882},{"title":"Console - time\\(String label\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":906},{"title":"Console - Scoped, Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":934},{"title":"Console - time\\(String label\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":958},{"title":"Console - log\\(Object val1...val2, String msg, String subst1...subst2\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":1056},{"title":"Glide System API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideSystemScopedAPI.md","line":1096},{"title":"Console - Scoped, Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":1120},{"title":"Console - Scoped, Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md","line":1132},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":1172}],"metadata":{"title":"Console - Scoped, Global","description":"The Console API provides methods to log messages to the system log, create and stop timers, create and log counters, log stack traces, and group/organize related content.Logs an error message to system logs if the assertion is false. This method does nothing if the assertion is true.Counts and logs the number of times that count\\(\\) has been called with a specified label.Resets the specified counter to zero.Logs or outputs a debugging message to the system log at the debug level.Logs a message to the system log at the error level.Creates a new inline group in the system log, where all subsequent messages are indented at an additional level until groupEnd\\(\\) is called. Use this method to visually organize and group related messages in output and system logs.Exits the current inline group created with group\\(\\) and decreases the indent by one level.Logs a message to system logs at the info level.Logs a message to system logs.Starts a timer you can use to track how long an operation takes.Stops a specified timer that was previously started by calling time\\(\\).Logs the current value of a specified timer to the system log.Logs a stack trace to the system log at the info level.Logs a warning message to the system log at the warning level.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":25,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[50,55],[59,61],[65,70],[80,90],[96,98],[102,104],[108,110],[193,196],[200,202],[208,211],[215,217],[223,226],[230,232],[271,277],[281,287],[291,295],[299,303],[342,353],[357,363],[367,378],[382,388],[455,473],[542,547],[588,599],[603,612],[616,621],[625,629],[633,638],[642,646],[662,673],[677,684],[747,752],[815,820],[863,876],[915,928],[979,984],[988,991],[995,998],[1002,1005],[1009,1020],[1024,1028],[1065,1079],[1085,1090],[1153,1163]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/ConsoleAPI.md"},
